  LastBuildReport: "WorldBuilder \u2014 20 placed, 0 missing, 288 colliders, 4.0s\nconfig.ts
    cdbbaccf6923  districts:True places:True colliders:True\n\nPLACED\n  Ground 1400
    x 1400 m @ y -0.05, solid over Unity x [-700, 430] (trimmed at the shore)\n 
    Roads 13 spline(s), 1864 m total, 8 m wide @ y 0.02\n  Water 2400 x 600 m @ Unity
    x [430, 2830], level 0\n  Beach 100 x 600 m, Unity x [405, 505], ramps to y -3\n 
    Shore wall 3 x 8 x 600 m @ Unity x 430 (Ignore Raycast, collider only)\n  District_FirstOne
    @ (0, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity3 @ (-156, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity2
    @ (150, 0, 0)\n  District_ProceduralCity4 @ (0, 0, 245)\n  District_ProceduralCity5
    @ (0, 0, -285)\n  District_ProceduralCity6 @ (-305, 0, 188)\n  District_ProceduralCity7
    @ (311, 0, 198)\n  District_ReichmanUniversity @ (216.9, 0, -170)\n  District_ParkingLot
    @ (216.9, 0, -246)\n  Place_SevenEleven @ (-37, 0.22, -15) yaw 90\xB0\n  Place_PizzaPlace
    @ (-20, 0.15, -100) yaw 0\xB0\n  Place_GasStation @ (320.9, 0, -123.3) yaw 0\xB0\n 
    Place_PoliceStation @ (160, 0, -124.5) yaw 180\xB0\n  Place_PizzaInterior @ (-1000,
    0, 1000)\n  LotCars \u2014 101 parked cars in 101 filled stalls\n\nWARNINGS\n 
    Pizza Place \u2014 stand-in low_poly_pizza_restaurant.glb for pizza-lila.glb:
    lies on its back out of the box; righted and lifted onto the pavement\n  Gas
    Station \u2014 gas-station.glb corrected on import: Sketchfab export imports
    with Y and Z swapped; righted\n\nSTILL BLENDED \u2014 deliberate; suspects if
    anything else renders pale\n  Building Facade.001, CityGenGlass.001, CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0047_1_masked_S,
    CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0057_1_masked_S, CityGenTCom_DecalsStain0094_2_masked_S,
    CityGen_lanes_secondary_color, Material, Material.001, Material.003, SE_glass,
